import all data from test table in database to meilisearch index :
sail artisan scout:import "App\Models\Test"

rebuild index (delete all data in index and import again) "using after editing the toSearchableArray function in model" :
sail artisan scout:import "App\Models\Test" --fresh

delete all data in index without import it again :
sail artisan scout:flush "App\Models\Test"

Sync index setting from config/scout.php to meilisearch index :
sail artisan scout:sync-index-settings

